## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `bun test` in `apps/app` and `packages/domain` to ensure the extraction didn't break functionality.
- Run `bun test packages/contracts` to verify the modified Zod schema.
- Write/update tests in `uploads.spec.ts` to verify the new MIME type restriction and the filesystem mock.

### Manual Verification
- None required; automated test suite covers the domain service and API route logic.
